      "writtenOn": "2025-03-12T10:59:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per discussion, I wouldn\u0027t change the ordering here. Moving to the sync state machine here changes the ordering of events (with the old async state machine, the tetherstate is removed *before* the IpServer stops; with the sync state machine the IpServer is stopped while the tetherstate still exists) and may be causing flaky behaviour, but it seems better *not* to fix that in this CL and instead submit a separate CL to address that.",
